# Cloudflare Pages redirects

# Root redirect to main index.html
/  /index.html  200

# Profile redirects to new location
/profile  /profile/profile.html  200
/profile/  /profile/profile.html  200

# Fallback для неизвестных путей
/admin/*  /index.html  200
/api/*  /index.html  200

# Catch-all fallback
/*  /index.html  200